Nimbus bitmap fonts from Rockbox (https://github.com/Rockbox/rockbox,
fonts/), unmodified: 14-Nimbus.bdf, 19-Nimbus.bdf, 35-Nimbus.bdf.
Rockbox is GPL-2.0-or-later; the BDFs' own notices: 14 "Public domain
font. Share and enjoy.", 19 and 35 "Copyright (c) 2006/2010 Alexander
Levin". Bitmap renderings of URW's Nimbus Sans.

bdf2lvgl.py turns them into LVGL fonts at build time (see ../Makefile);
the clock face is 35-Nimbus at 2x (nearest-neighbour, stays crisp).
